[01:50.46] That the word was hurled
[01:55.11] Barrytown people got to be
[01:57.93] From another world
[02:09.92] Leave me or I'll be just like
[02:13.03] The others you will meet
[02:17.34] They won't act as kindly
[02:20.24] If they see you on the street
